    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the city of Petr\u00f3polis.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What seemed like just another reconnaissance mission quickly turns into a living nightmare. Three forest rangers and a mysterious ABIN agent are sent to the isolated Santa Tereza Mansion, deep in the mountains of Petr\u00f3polis. But something goes terribly wrong \u2014 and the team is torn apart by forces beyond comprehension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Marcos Nunes</strong>, a seasoned officer now stranded alone in a place filled with secrets and threats. To survive, Marcos must search the mansion, gather vital resources, and face disturbing creatures lurking in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deadly Contagion</strong> is a <strong>survival horror experience</strong> inspired by the classics of the genre. Get ready for a dense atmosphere, environmental puzzles, tense encounters, and a story full of chilling mysteries. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570740/extras/1b2c523315c89384bc87310bf3a6766e.poster.avif?t=1748037640\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570740/extras/1b2c523315c89384bc87310bf3a6766e.webm?t=1748037640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570740/extras/1b2c523315c89384bc87310bf3a6766e.mp4?t=1748037640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the city of Petr\u00f3polis.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What seemed like just another reconnaissance mission quickly turns into a living nightmare. Three forest rangers and a mysterious ABIN agent are sent to the isolated Santa Tereza Mansion, deep in the mountains of Petr\u00f3polis. But something goes terribly wrong \u2014 and the team is torn apart by forces beyond comprehension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Marcos Nunes</strong>, a seasoned officer now stranded alone in a place filled with secrets and threats. To survive, Marcos must search the mansion, gather vital resources, and face disturbing creatures lurking in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deadly Contagion</strong> is a <strong>survival horror experience</strong> inspired by the classics of the genre. Get ready for a dense atmosphere, environmental puzzles, tense encounters, and a story full of chilling mysteries. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570740/extras/1b2c523315c89384bc87310bf3a6766e.poster.avif?t=1748037640\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570740/extras/1b2c523315c89384bc87310bf3a6766e.webm?t=1748037640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570740/extras/1b2c523315c89384bc87310bf3a6766e.mp4?t=1748037640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
